From c302675f2636354681f08b57ca03d383d0d6f3d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Danil Somsikov <dsv@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:48:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/32] [DevTools] Check origin access permissions in
 StorageHandler

Verify client_->MayAttachToURL via StorageHandler::CanAccessOrigin before
clearing storage, querying/overriding quota, or managing storage buckets
for a given origin or storage key. This prevents a debugger-permission
extension attached to a regular web tab from clearing or manipulating
another extension's storage.

Bug: 568576341
Change-Id: Ic5258ffe0072da002d878c82a38d6b578fccd1d4
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8579258
